OL,3,AThree Iran-backed suspects plotted
OL,4,Aattacks including RAF Fairford
OL,5,Aincident, US says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US Department of Justice (DOJ) has
OL,8,Fannounced charges against three
OL,9,FIran-backed operatives that it alleges
OL,10,Fwere involved in a string of plots in
OL,11,Fthe US and Europe.
OL,13,FThe DOJ said Iranian agents most
OL,14,Frecently "orchestrated a terrorist plot
OL,15,Fat an air force base in the United
OL,16,FKingdom", saying they were involved in
OL,17,Fthe major incident in September near
OL,18,FRAF Fairford in the UK, where US armed
OL,19,Fforces were stationed.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
