OL,3,ASix thousand Italian schools hit by
OL,4,Athreats in suspected bomb hoax
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeparately, more than 700 schools in
OL,7,FScotland and Northern Ireland also
OL,8,Freceived hoax bomb threats. It is
OL,9,Funclear whether any of the incidents
OL,10,Fare connected.
OL,12,FIn Italy a number of buildings were
OL,13,Fevacuated as a precaution but Prime
OL,14,FMinister Giorgia Meloni said checks so
OL,15,Ffar had not indicated any evidence of
OL,16,F"concrete danger".
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
